{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061459/block/singleImage/3254885/df/01M6BX3GG8H1DEN1X2ZQA914ET.jpg?updatedAt=1793548500\"/><p>「第20屆大角咀廟會」昨於大角咀舉行，全日吸引逾18萬人次參與。全日有不同活動，包括近千人參與的巡遊中有醒獅、舞龍、服裝表演等；福全街兩旁則設有逾50個特色攤位，提供懷舊小食及經典玩具，另更舉行千人盆菜宴。而晚上壓軸登場的500呎炫彩LED夜光花式龍及「沙頭角魚燈舞」最受矚目。夜光龍與魚燈在夜色中隨鼓聲起舞，場面壯觀，吸引不少市民駐足觀賞及打卡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.744152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T16:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.900474+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:52.599548+00:00","content_hash":"f15b2ce51b55b067434c98d8a6e993cdfa4df1a99b5498b3e106599fc4fa6012","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.744152+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}